Vintr, Tomas; Blaha, Jan; Rektoris, Martin; Ulrich, Jiri; Roucek, Tomas; Broughton, George; Krajnik, Tomas, Czech Tech Univ, Fac Elect Engn, Artificial Intelligence Ctr, Dept Comp Sci,Lab Chronorobot, Prague, Czech Republic.
Yan, Zhi, Univ Bourgogne Franche Comte, CIAD UMR 7533, UTBM, Montbeliard, France.},
